{"id":"9398b95a78da977c","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-separation-instance.md","title":"ZFC Set10 Bounded Separation Instance","display":"df-zfc-set10-bounded-separation-instance — ZFC Set10 Bounded Separation Instance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-separation-instance","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-separation-instance"],"display":"df-zfc-set10-bounded-separation-instance — ZFC Set10 Bounded Separation Instance","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]","[[58-thm-separation]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-separation-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set10-bounded-separation-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set10-bounded-separation-instance — ZFC Set10 Bounded Separation Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2678ecfefaa83e32\" href=\"?note=2678ecfefaa83e32\" title=\"58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula\">58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2403aee408c56d4d\" href=\"?note=2403aee408c56d4d\" title=\"58-thm-separation\">58-thm-separation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,\\varphi,p,s\\in V\">\\(A,B,\\varphi,p,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\in V\\)</span> is the membership language and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1,\\ldots\">\\(v_0,v_1,\\ldots\\)</span> are its coded variables</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2678ecfefaa83e32\" href=\"?note=2678ecfefaa83e32\" title=\"58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula\">58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:V\\to V\\)</span> are sourced coding interfaces</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ParameterAssignment}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ParameterAssignment}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> is the finite free-variable assignment relation defined here</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\Delta_0,\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\Delta_0,\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 是下式定义的二元关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 使用书内有限公式递归，并只在有界公式上调用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedSeparationInstance}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedSeparationInstance}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}assignment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ParameterAssignment}_S(s,x,p,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists B_p\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,n,B_p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n+1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land s=\\{\\langle v_0,x\\rangle\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle v_{i+1},p(i)\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}parameter\\text{-}assignment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ParameterAssignment}_S(s,x,p,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists B_p\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(p,n,B_p)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\n\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n+1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land s=\\{\\langle v_0,x\\rangle\\}\n\\cup\\{\\langle v_{i+1},p(i)\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}separation\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedSeparationInstance}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land B=\\{x\\in A:\\exists s\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{ParameterAssignment}_S(s,x,p,\\varphi)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\Delta_0,\\mathrm{meta}}(\\varphi,s))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}separation\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10BoundedSeparationInstance}_S(B,A,\\varphi,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land B=\\{x\\in A:\\exists s\\in V\\;\n(\\mathrm{ParameterAssignment}_S(s,x,p,\\varphi)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\Delta_0,\\mathrm{meta}}(\\varphi,s))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\Delta_0,\\mathrm{meta}}(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(V,\\varphi,s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\Delta_0,\\mathrm{meta}}(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(V,\\varphi,s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The finite parameter tuple is decoded into an assignment that covers every free variable of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>; the fourth argument of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ParameterAssignment}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ParameterAssignment}_S\\)</span> is therefore no longer semantically ignored.</li>\n<li>The sourced bounded-formula predicate takes both a formula code and a signature.  Bounded truth over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is explicitly metalinguistic; it is not asserted to be a set-coded truth predicate for the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2678ecfefaa83e32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-separation","status":"resolved","id":"2403aee408c56d4d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-separation]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2678ecfefaa83e32","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula]])","embed":fa